{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「Jayden之亂」熱潮月前席捲全城，掀起話題的「Jayden媽咪」拍檔Matthew與Janice Wan，因神還原港媽說話語氣令一系列影片爆紅，不過二人其後驚爆反面，兩人被發現互相取消追蹤兼下架合作短片，Matthew率先於社交媒體留言暗寸有人「凡事只講利益、背後打毒針」，Janice相隔數星期亦終拍片回應，轟Matthew性格難夾態度差、在Close Friends限時動態公審自己及過橋抽板等；而Matthew則還擊指Janice當他廉價勞工及工具人，而非平等合作關係，更批評對方在背後中傷他、講一套做一套、消費其善良等。二人隔空罵戰令不少網民食花生，就連五索、王海榛（Dada）都以「典型香港水魚媽咪」為題拍片抽水，不但複製「Jayden媽咪」語氣，對白更句句精警，暗藏Janice、Matthew互相指控的內容，例如：「Muffin呀，你而家有毛有翼識fly喇，你過橋抽Bridge就唔要Mami喇！」</p><figure><img alt=\"「Jayden之亂」熱潮月前席捲全城，掀起話題的「Jayden媽咪」拍檔Matthew與Janice Wan，因神還原港媽說話語氣令一系列影片爆紅，不過二人其後驚爆反面。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189959548937441280250816.jpeg/0J4BOpNVyIfS6VRDkZOZDUEqcEsk8w8ujOAzxozgM8Y\"/><figcaption>「Jayden之亂」熱潮月前席捲全城，掀起話題的「Jayden媽咪」拍檔Matthew與Janice Wan，因神還原港媽說話語氣令一系列影片爆紅，不過二人其後驚爆反面。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Matthew率先於社交媒體留言暗寸。（Threads截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189207129249026048490128.jpeg/J_MzG41xguWpyCtj2_ZM6hP8c0ytcjgCV5f1SVeX9Uk\"/><figcaption>Matthew率先於社交媒體留言暗寸。（Threads截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Janice承認曾講「性格好難夾」，指Matthew「過橋抽板」。（IG@janicewanwan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188623477339328512185042.jpeg/0YI9szDayYlQ3qexTMvDuBF99af1xCw4gNcfMIDXHzA\"/><figcaption>Janice承認曾講「性格好難夾」，指Matthew「過橋抽板」。（IG@janicewanwan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Matthew拍片列3點反擊。（IG/@matthewpwj_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189194951347933184674803.jpeg/MkFnAGdMiBVvYnptrlZyu-Jrl4VcXvF7jSJ3co0id3I\"/><figcaption>Matthew拍片列3點反擊。（IG/@matthewpwj_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Matthew表示沒辦法接受做一個廉價勞工，更加唔會為人哋嘅生意去孭飛。（IG/@matthewpwj_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189194944313692160431086.jpeg/4BIA55AoAEJwFYE6R684vL_Q7NuITrVcA50xVQOdMVU\"/><figcaption>Matthew表示沒辦法接受做一個廉價勞工，更加唔會為人哋嘅生意去孭飛。（IG/@matthewpwj_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（IG@5kidsokma、dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189960335117783040269147.jpeg/wj20PLQ3OimcmDFqwFDMXIK2FVmG4vG-Svr4dEr6-HQ\"/><figcaption>（IG@5kidsokma、dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><p>對白暗藏「Jayden媽咪」互罵指控　王海榛親解何謂「Poison noodle」</p><p>五索與Dada以「Jayden媽咪」中英夾雜語氣拍片，仔細發現對白其實藏有Matthew或Janice對對方的指控，除「過橋抽Bridge」指控外，又例如Dada說：「Mami用咗好多錢嚟Bring up你㗎，你知唔知你去Travel嗰啲錢呀，都係媽咪pay㗎！」正正對應Janice指自己包辦與Matthew去韓國釜山的機票住宿、主題樂園門票及飲食花費等，而「Mami同你Poison talk講嗰啲嘢，係trust你先同你講㗎嘛，你做咩要周圍sing Mami呀？你go tell everyone嘅？而家我冇打你Poison noodle喎！」就指向Janice批評Matthew將她分享的心事講出去。網民都指五索及Dada「靚抽」，但有人就問何謂「Poison noodle」，估計是由「Poison needle（毒針）」演變，Dada就搞笑回覆：「係呀，poison noodle😂😂😂唔係個個阿媽啲英文都係咁好㗎！」</p><figure><img alt=\"五索與Dada以「Jayden媽咪」中英夾雜語氣拍片，仔細發現對白其實藏有Matthew或Janice對對方的指控。（IG@5kidsokma、dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189960345562124288576380.jpeg/uXt0l-L5d9So1mKFds4lusHRIV5pmJ09sWH91bFh_dU\"/><figcaption>五索與Dada以「Jayden媽咪」中英夾雜語氣拍片，仔細發現對白其實藏有Matthew或Janice對對方的指控。（IG@5kidsokma、dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"除「過橋抽Bridge」指控外，又例如Dada說：「Mami用咗好多錢嚟Bring up你㗎，你知唔知你去Travel嗰啲錢呀，都係媽咪pay㗎！」正正對應Janice指自己包辦與Matthew去韓國釜山的機票住宿、主題樂園門票及飲食花費等。（IG@5kidsokma、dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189960337860988928724358.jpeg/LVaxFQ2F2QVIVuCQD2fReSo2ZzuG1xM6--a9dfvmvXU\"/><figcaption>除「過橋抽Bridge」指控外，又例如Dada說：「Mami用咗好多錢嚟Bring up你㗎，你知唔知你去Travel嗰啲錢呀，都係媽咪pay㗎！」正正對應Janice指自己包辦與Matthew去韓國釜山的機票住宿、主題樂園門票及飲食花費等。（IG@5kidsokma、dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"而「Mami同你Poison talk講嗰啲嘢，係trust你先同你講㗎嘛，你做咩要周圍sing Mami呀？你go tell everyone嘅？而家我冇打你Poison noodle喎！」就指向Janice批評Matthew將她分享的心事講出去。（IG@5kidsokma、dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189960340394479616980352.jpeg/6GtSkOtL3dwesZJyiXMfYSFYJC--yEvFShEQsEoRELA\"/><figcaption>而「Mami同你Poison talk講嗰啲嘢，係trust你先同你講㗎嘛，你做咩要周圍sing Mami呀？你go tell everyone嘅？而家我冇打你Poison noodle喎！」就指向Janice批評Matthew將她分享的心事講出去。（IG@5kidsokma、dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有人就問何謂「Poison noodle」，估計是由「Poison needle（毒針）」演變，Dada就搞笑回覆：「係呀，poison noodle😂😂😂唔係個個阿媽啲英文都係咁好㗎！」（IG@5kidsokma、dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189960342915387392869170.jpeg/RaEvx4D5OBXHz1rg-n9KTJZtJy459f3PgO3vCYDt7wk\"/><figcaption>有人就問何謂「Poison noodle」，估計是由「Poison needle（毒針）」演變，Dada就搞笑回覆：「係呀，poison noodle😂😂😂唔係個個阿媽啲英文都係咁好㗎！」（IG@5kidsokma、dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:41:37.039404+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1654,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:30:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T14:17:50.409311+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:37:44.177015+00:00","content_hash":"dfab9c47184b219bf3639e188716b163e9613e646e2a60b216a11f12bc136671","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}